    "descriptionLong": "Your everyday safety companion, Safio is a smart personal alarm designed to give you confidence and peace of mind wherever you go. Easily attach it to your keys, bag, or clothing so it’s always within reach when you need it. In case of emergency, Safio can be activated instantly with one hand, triggering a powerful 150 dB alarm and bright flashing lights to draw attention and deter unwanted situations. At the same time, it enables instant emergency contact notification and live location sharing via a simple BT connection to your mobile device, keeping you connected when it matters most — no app or SIM card required. Designed for real-life use, Safio is USB-C rechargeable, making it easy to keep powered and ready at all times. Compact, reliable, and easy to use, Safio is made to support you in your daily routine with confidence and simplicity. Made with RCS (Recycled Claim Standard) certified recycled ABS, the total recycled content is 28% based on the total item weight.",
