    "descriptionLong": "Meet your everyday safety companion. Guard Buddy is a compact personal alarm designed to give you confidence wherever you go. Simply attach it to your keys, bag, or clothing using the keychain or clip, so it’s always within easy reach when you need it. In case of emergency, just pull Guard Buddy from the keychain to instantly activate a powerful 150 dB alarm and super bright flashing LED lights, helping to draw attention and deter unwanted situations. Designed for real-life use, it features an IPX4 waterproof rating and a rechargeable battery that can be easily powered via USB-C, so it’s always ready when you are. Small, reliable, and easy to carry, Guard Buddy is made to support you in your daily routine with peace of mind and simplicity. Made with RCS (Recycled Claim Standard) certified recycled ABS, the total recycled content is 28% based on the total item weight. Item and accessories are PVC free and packed in FSC plastic-free packaging.",
